ing","summary":"Be sure to visit this palace-turned-hotel of the Mysore Maharaja. Extremely beautiful place and quite affordable tea-snacks and slightly expensive buffet dinner. The palace and its estate are beautiful and are open to guests. The locals often will call it Mysore Palace to avoid confusion with the Fern Hill Hotel.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Ooty","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/One_Color_at_a_Time.jpg/1280px-One_Color_at_a_Time.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/One_Color_at_a_Time.jpg/500px-One_Color_at_a_Time.jpg","w":1200,"h":1218,"author":"Samridhi123","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:One_Color_at_a_Time.jpg"}},{"id":"ooty_wv_wax_world","areaId":"ooty","name":"Wax World","category":"museum","tags":["museums"],"location":{"lat":11.41736,"lng":76.71559},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"ooty_wv_wax_world","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":3,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21"},"hashtags":["waxworld","ooty"],"hours":{"week":[null,{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Closed Mon; Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"It is a private investment not supported by the government. Don't expect much like other foreign wax museums which are helped by tourism authorities for advertisements and promotions. But for sight seeing its good. More attractive is the very old house, where the museum is set up. Candles are available. But it is suffering from a lack of funds for expansion so they request tourists to visit and to","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Ooty","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/043_Gove